cm</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width=590 align=center border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0><tr><td height=12></td></tr></table><TABLE width=590 align=center border=0><TR><TD width=20></TD><TD><b>Explanation： </b>The average height of adult men in China is 1.69 meters, and that of adult women is 1.58 meters。</TD></TR><TR><TD width=20></TD><TD>The formula for predicting the standard height of the human body (genetic law)<br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Male height=(Father's height+Mother's height)×1.08÷2(Centimeter)<br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Female height=(Father's height×0.923+Mother's height)÷2(Centimeter)</TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE width=590 align=center border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0><tr><td height=20></td></tr></table><TABLE width=590 align=center border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0><tr>  <td height=12></td></tr></table><TABLE align=center cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=600 bgColor=#c0c0c0 border=1><TR><TD align=middle width=124 bgColor=#c0c0c0><B><FONT size=2>property</FONT></B></TD><TD align=middle width=150><B>  <FONT size=2>Low standard</FONT></B></TD><TD align=middle width=100><B><FONT size=2>Standard</FONT></B></TD><TD align=middle width=226><B><FONT size=2>Exceed the standard</FONT></B></TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE align=center cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0       width=600 border=0><TR><TD width=100>&nbsp;<WBR></TD><TD align=middle width=50>|</TD><TD align=middle width=50>|</TD><TD align=middle width=50>|</TD><TD align=middle width=50>|</TD><TD align=middle width=50>|</TD><TD align=middle  width=50>|</TD><TD align=middle width=50>|</TD><TD align=middle width=50>|</TD><TD align=middle width=50>|</TD><TD align=middle width=50>|</TD></TD></TR><TR><TD width=100>&nbsp;<WBR></TD><TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>60%  </FONT></TD><TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>70%</FONT></TD><TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>80%</FONT></TD><TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>90%</FONT></TD><TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>100%</FONT></TD>  <TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>110%</FONT></TD><TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>120%</FONT></TD><TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>130%</FONT></TD><TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>140%</FONT></TD>          <TD align=middle width=50><FONT size=2>150%</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE><TABLE align=center cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=600 border=0><TR><TD width=125 align=center><FONT size=2>②Body weight(Kg)</FONT></TD><TD align=left width=475      colSpan=10 valign=center><img src=Mark.jpg width=MyValue12
